# TTP-2026-0510 — Sudo Authentication Brute Force on the Linux Syslog Feed
# XQL paste-buffer generated by detection_scanner/scripts/export_artifacts.py

## VALIDATION — Repeated sudo PAM Auth Failures Then a Success
# purpose: validation
# dataset: linux_syslog

dataset = linux_syslog
| filter process = "sudo" and message contains "authentication failure"
| comp count() as fails by user, host
| filter fails >= 3

